## Deploy requirements

These environment variables must be set in the deploy environment (names only, values are never written here):

- PUBLIC_DEMO_TENANT_ID: tenant served to the public demo
- APP_DATABASE_URL: non-owner database role so row level security applies
- TENANT_API_KEYS: map of tenant id to API key for n8n
- OWNER_EMAIL: address for escalation alerts
- RETENTION_DAYS: days to keep personal data, 0 keeps everything

